      "message": "fix(import): the edge-gap note follows the widened law; pin the real fixture\n\nThe #2994 import note said a program cannot be posted at a 0.02 mm\nchord. Under #2996 it can, so loosened_consequence reads the widened\nrange first. A new pin posts a Face on edge_gap_018_stated_010.step\nwith the header note. The decision file lists the strict readers.\n\nRefs #2996\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
